[26.009588, "o", "On page 8 of `attention.pdf`, the big Transformer scores:\r\n\r\n- **English-to-German (WMT 2014): 28.4 BLEU.** That beats the best earlier models, ensembles included, by more than 2.0 BLEU and set a new state of the art (Section 6.1 and Table 2).\r\n- **English-to-French (WMT 2014):** Table 2 gives **41.8 BLEU**, but the text on the same page says \"our big model achieves a BLEU score of 41.0.\" The PDF disagrees with itself here. (Later arXiv versions of the paper use 41.8 in both places.)\r\n"]
